{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to clear out massive waves of super ultra-mega-hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each battle lasts about 5-6 minutes \u2013 perfect for quick sessions anytime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/2.png?t=1747453199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warriors will automatically attack enemies. Each kill grants XP. When they level up, you'll get enhancement cards to strengthen your warriors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/4.png?t=1747453199\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warriors have synergies \u2013 for example, if you unlock the &quot;Energy Sense&quot; ability, magic waves will trigger a ring of smaller magic waves upon contacting electromagnetic fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relics drop during combat, and powerful ones will significantly boost your firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/3.png?t=1747453199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters have specific weaknesses or traits. Exploiting these vulnerabilities allows more efficient elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/extras/\u602a\u7269\u4ecb\u7ecd.png?t=1747453199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come and experience the battlefield in person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703380?t=1747453199","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703380?t=1747453199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703380/